{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2943789","formula":"C₁₂H₉N₃O₅S","hill":"C12H9N3O5S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":12.0,"H":9.0,"N":3.0,"O":5.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Nitazoxanide","uk":"Нітазоксанід"},"descriptions":{"en":"Nitazoxanide, sold under the brand name Alinia among others, is a broad-spectrum antiparasitic and broad-spectrum antiviral medication that is used in medicine for the treatment of various helminthic, protozoal, and viral infections. It is indicated for the treatment of infection by Cryptosporidium parvum and Giardia lamblia in immunocompetent individuals and has been repurposed for the treatment of influenza. Nitazoxanide has also been shown to have in vitro antiparasitic activity and clinical treatment efficacy for infections caused by other protozoa and helminths; evidence as of 2014 suggested that it possesses efficacy in treating a number of viral infections as well.","uk":"Нітазоксанід (англ. Nitazoxanide) — синтетичний противірусний препарат, протиглисний та антипротозойний препарат, який є похідним тіазолідів. Нітазоксанід застосовується перорально."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":41684,"mass":307.28,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(=O)OC1=CC=CC=C1C(=O)NC2=NC=C(S2)[N+](=O)[O-]","inchikey":"YQNQNVDNTFHQSW-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"[2-[(5-nitro-1,3-thiazol-2-yl)carbamoyl]phenyl] acetate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"41684","atoms":30,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.937,"y":-1.048,"z":0.626,"el":"S"},{"x":-3.223,"y":1.259,"z":-0.487,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.748,"y":0.948,"z":-1.361,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.902,"y":1.572,"z":1.811,"el":"O"},{"x":6.332,"y":0.674,"z":-0.093,"el":"O"},{"x":5.812,"y":-1.101,"z":1.099,"el":"O"},{"x":0.448,"y":-0.608,"z":-0.067,"el":"N"},{"x":2.145,"y":0.894,"z":-0.886,"el":"N"},{"x":5.471,"y":-0.136,"z":0